[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3.27, "timestamp": "00:00:03", "text": "提醒一下 Jock，呃，11，呃，14。我想是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4.87, "timestamp": "00:00:04", "text": "成功了。成功了。他做过一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8.23, "timestamp": "00:00:08", "text": "正确的？这就足够了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12.23, "timestamp": "00:00:12", "text": "是的，成功了。 14. 是的，成功了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15.35, "timestamp": "00:00:15", "text": "正如你所看到的，你的信息是“是的”，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19.99, "timestamp": "00:00:19", "text": "谢谢你，14号。好的，阿斯特拉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22.07, "timestamp": "00:00:22", "text": "你现在想要紫色的那件吗？好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 31.83, "timestamp": "00:00:31", "text": "我觉得这速度太快了。呃，我想我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 36.87, "timestamp": "00:00:36", "text": "得像13岁那样走。哦，真快。"}]